## Stack

- Go 1.22+, stdlib `net/http.ServeMux`
- SQLite via [modernc.org/sqlite](https://gitlab.com/cznic/sqlite) (pure Go, no CGo)
- Migrations via [goose](https://github.com/pressly/goose)
- Background jobs via [goqite](https://maragu.dev/goqite)
- Auth primitives: argon2id password hashing, cookie-backed sessions
- Mail: pluggable `mailer.Mailer` interface, Postmark default
- Observability: Sentry (optional), Prometheus `/metrics`, `/healthz`

## Local development

```sh
cp .env.example .env
go run ./cmd/server
```

Visit http://localhost:3000.

## Layout

```
cmd/server/         entry point (HTTP server + wiring)
internal/auth/      argon2 + sessions + middleware
internal/jobs/      jobs.Queue interface + goqite implementation
internal/mail/      mailer.Mailer interface + Postmark + recorder
internal/router/    router, middleware, /healthz, /metrics
internal/observability/  Sentry init
migrations/         goose migrations (embedded)
queries/            sqlc query files (run `sqlc generate` after make:resource)
views/              templ layouts and partials
assets/             CSS / JS source
.serenity/          project-local generator overrides
```

